{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le07ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le07ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Vanessa, I haven't seen you in ages! How have you been?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Amy! I've been better than ever, thanks. I've only just begun my culinary classes and recently I've been meditating and doing yoga almost daily. How about you?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Great, I'm just on my way to the community center to get some information on volunteering.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Volunteering? But you've already got so much on the go!\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: It's like I said in my course, Vanessa, we're never too busy to help those less fortunate than us. Have you ever volunteered?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't done any yet. I have a lot on my plate at the moment. One step at a time, you know.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span> : Of course, you've got to pace yourself, <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Your course was a real eye-opener, but I have only just begun to take stock of my place in the world. Up to now I haven't had time to even think about taking on any new challenges. Maybe in a few weeks I'll have you set me up an appointment, if you don't mind.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Not at all, there's no rush. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Now that I think about it, I actually have a contact at a local grassroots charity. They could really use a hand. I'll have her get in touch with you, if that's okay.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: That would be great. Have her call me on my cell, if possible. I'm going to have my landline removed, so that number is no longer valid. What do they do, exactly?", "id": 2, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn10le07ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: They do humanitarian work in Lesotho.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Lesotho? I've never even heard of it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's an impoverished country located within the borders of South Africa. I've never been, but I've heard it's been devastated by the AIDS pandemic. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well it certainly sounds like a worthwhile endeavor. Please do have her reach out to me.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Will do!", "id": 3, "time": "73500", "image": "engenn10le07ob01re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about social issues and moral dilemmas."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about having something done. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about unusual events in the past. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Have you ever volunteered? Where?                                       "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Would you like to volunteer in the future? Why? Why not?                                                                        "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How could more people be encouraged to volunteer?        "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}],