imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "community center "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "A place where locals can meet to play sports or take courses"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Great, I'm just on my way to the community center to get some information on volunteering."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about helping your community."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "volunteering"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of giving your time in order to help the less fortunate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Volunteering is a great way to help your community."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have a lot on one's plate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "To be very busy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a lot on my plate at the moment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grassroots"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "involving ordinary local people as opposed to professionals"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Now that I think about it, I actually have a contact at a local grassroots charity. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "humanitarian"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "involving charity work or helping less fortunate people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They do humanitarian work in Lesotho."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "impoverished"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extremely poor"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's an impoverished country located within the borders of South Africa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to devastate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cause great damage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It has been devastated by the AIDS pandemic. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pandemic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a disease that affects large numbers of people at the same time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The pandemic now affected 32 countries."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eye-opener"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that surprises you and allows you to see things in a new way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your course was a real eye-opener."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Causative Verb: Have"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " The verb <span class=\"italic\">to have </span>has several meanings in English. It can be use to show the causative.                                                                                                    "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Let's review the uses of  <span class=\"italic\">to have</span>:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To describe possession\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a large family.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To describe experience\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I had a great time last night.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To describe condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a terrible cold.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use a causative verb when you want to talk about something that someone else did for you or for another person. It means that the subject caused the action to happen, but didn't do it themselves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the causative verb <span class=\"italic\"> to have</span> when you want to make it clear that the subject paid, asked, or persuaded the other person to do something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Have your spouse or housemates clean up after themselves. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In this sentence<span class=\"italic\"> you </span>ask or persuade your spouse or housemates to clean up after themselves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the causative is:<br/> have + object + verb"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll have you set me up an appointment, if you don't mind."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Have her call me on my cell."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to have my landline removed."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Please do have her reach out to me."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect for Unusual Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about past events or actions that have a connection to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are certain words that you usually use in sentences with the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Perfect</span> tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for some examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Words\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Just<br/> <br/> Only just<br/> <br/> Recently\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In sentences that talk or ask about events that happened in the recent past and may still be happening now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  I've only just begun my culinary classes and recently I've been meditating and doing yoga almost daily</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"So far<br/><br/> Until now<br/> <br/> Up to now\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In sentences that talk or ask about events that started in the recent past and continue into the present.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Up to now I haven't had time to even think about taking on any new challenges</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ever\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In questions that ask about experience.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Have you ever volunteered</span>?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In questions and negative statements\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I haven't done any volunteering yet</span>.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le07ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you won one million dollars. Write down a list of ten things you would buy for yourself or for others."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of all the things that you would no longer do for yourself."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Expand your list into full sentences "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your list to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of things I would like to have."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of things I would have done for me."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I expand my lists into complete sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my list with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}